    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Out of Tune is Mojave 3’s second album, originally released in 1998 on 4AD and reissued in 2026 as a remaster. It finds the former Slowdive members moving further away from shoegaze haze and into a warmer, more song-focused sound, built around acoustic guitars, hushed vocals, and gently rolling arrangements.\n\nThe record deepens the band’s pastoral blend of rock, folk, and dream-pop, with songs like “Who Do You Love,” “Some Kinda Angel,” and “Caught Beneath Your Heel” showing the group’s growing confidence in melody and texture. Reviewers have often singled it out as one of Mojave 3’s strongest albums, noting its intimate mood, soft harmonies, and the added color of organ and other subtle instrumentation.",
